# The registry itself is on the `volunteers` branch, accepted only from a verified maintainer commit (collect.yml).
# These paths decide who may feed the site with timetables and what runs on crawling machines (the home runner
# and every volunteer's): a change to any of them needs the owner's review (docs/WOLONTARIUSZE.md, docs/REFRESH.md).
/tools/volunteer/                       @kilerdevs
/tools/refresh/                         @kilerdevs
/tools/egress/                          @kilerdevs
/.github/actions/refresh/               @kilerdevs
/.github/workflows/refresh.yml          @kilerdevs
/.github/workflows/collect.yml          @kilerdevs
/.github/workflows/volunteer.yml        @kilerdevs
/.github/workflows/crawler-image.yml    @kilerdevs
/.github/CODEOWNERS                     @kilerdevs
